{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id933525493"}, "name":{"label":"¥Abbie¥"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-12-07T07:05:28-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.77.0"}, "id":{"label":"10667093201"}, "title":{"label":"Super useful!"}, "content":{"label":"My entire life I have suffered massively with dehydration and as I’ve gotten older and chronic illness has made itself present in my life, being hydrated is something I have to take care of.\n\nI have never been good at drinking water but this app has helped me massively. I’ve been using it for about 3 weeks now (I have paid the one off fee for the lifetime access which I think was an excellent price!) and have been motivated everyday to fill my quota of water! It’s super helpful in tailoring the right amount of fluid intake for you and individualises it excellently! I love that it goes onto my Apple watch too!\n\nIt’s like a daily little challenge which is great for the motivation to stay hydrated and the reminders are great with sharing the benefits of hydration!\n\nA really great app!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
